  57:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1_IntClock.c **** * Summary:
  58:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1_IntClock.c **** *  Stops the clock and returns immediately. This API does not require the
  59:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1_IntClock.c **** *  source clock to be running but may return before the hardware is actually
  60:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1_IntClock.c **** *  disabled. If the settings of the clock are changed after calling this
  61:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1_IntClock.c **** *  function, the clock may glitch when it is started. To avoid the clock
  62:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_SAR_Seq_1_IntClock.c **** *  glitch, use the StopBlock function.
